    "en": {
      "trackName": "MiniHue: Color Mini Sudoku 6x6",
      "description": "MiniHue turns mini sudoku into a fast, visual color ritual.\n\nFill each 6×6 grid so every row, column, and 2×3 box contains all six colors exactly once. Learn the rules in seconds, finish a round in minutes, and come back every day for a fresh logic reset.\n\nWHY PLAY MINIHUE\n• Color-first mini sudoku that is easier to scan than numbers\n• Daily puzzle, streak tracking, and Game Center leaderboards\n• Easy, Medium, and Hard grids for short breaks or longer focus sessions\n• Pencil marks, batch fill, and hints when you get stuck\n• Five themes, custom palettes, and symbols for accessibility\n• Offline play, Home Screen widget, and iCloud sync across devices\n• Free to start, one premium unlock, no subscription\n\nIf you love mini sudoku, Nikoli-style logic, and calm daily brain games, MiniHue brings a fresh color twist.",
      "releaseNotes": "MiniHue is now on Apple Watch — a little color puzzle, always close at hand.\n\nEnjoy clearer colors and a smoother puzzle experience. We've improved candidate notes and guided practice, fixed reported issues, and refined everyday play.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/minihue-color-mini-sudoku-6x6/id6761858520?uo=4",
